# Reggae-pop / island-pop hooks (style: latin, substyle: reggae-pop): 8 verses, 6 pre-choruses, 7 choruses, 4 bridges.
# Laid-back phrases that start after the beat, offbeat (skank) accents, space on beat 1, singalong choruses built
# on repeated notes and small steps over simple loops. Sung pitch, C4 = middle C.

